            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.135.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "135:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Enju ei ndikwenda kwombeka neija kuba mpango munonga; ahabw'okuba Ruhanga waitu ni mukuru okukira baaruhanga boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.8.27"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 8:27",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.66.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 66:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ACT.7.49"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Byak 7:49",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu n'oha orikubaasa kumwombekyera enju, ku araabe atarikuhika mu iguru, n'obu ryakuba iguru eririkweshumba agandi? Mbwenu niinye oha kumwombekyera enju, kureka ebe ey'okwotereramu obubaane omu maisho ge? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.22.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bus 22:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mbwenu nyoherereza omushaija omunyamyoga, ow'okukora eby'ezaabu, eby'efeeza, eby'emiringa, n'eby'ebyoma, kandi n'eby'emyenda ya bujwa, eya karari, n'eya bururu, kandi orikumanya kusharura amabara, agume n'abanyamyoga abu nyine omuri Yuda na Yerusaalemu, abu tata Daudi yaataireho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ontwekyere embaaho z'emyereezi n'emiberooshi n'emiti ya aligumu ebya Lebanooni; ahakuba nimmanya abashaija baawe ku barikumanya kushara ebiti by'embaaho omuri Lebanooni. Kandi abashaija bangye baryakwatanisa n'abaawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "babone kunteekateekyera embaaho nyingi munonga; ahakuba enju ei ndikwenda kwombeka neija kuba mpango kandi erikutangaaza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ndyaha abashaija baawe, ababaizi b'okushara embaaho, encuro z'engano ezihwire obukumi bubiri, n'encuro za sayiri obukumi bubiri, n'enjoga za viinyo obukumi bubiri, n'entsimbo z'amajuta obukumi bubiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
