            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.9.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Bus 9:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Hiraamu omugabe wa Tuuro yaahandikira Sulemaani ebaruha, ei yaamutwekyeire, naamugarukamu ati: Ahabwa MUKAMA kukunda abantu be, nikyo akugiriire omugabe waabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiraamu yaagaruka yaagira ati: MUKAMA Ruhanga wa Israeli, owaahangire eiguru n'ensi, ahimbisibwe, ahabw'okuba ahaire Daudi omwana w'obwengye, omwerinzi kandi orikwetegyereza, kuba niwe yaayombekyera MUKAMA enju, kandi n'okweyombekyera nyaruju y'obugabe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbwenu naayohereza omushaija omunyamyoga, orikwetegyereza munonga, orikwetwa Huraamu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1KI.7.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Bag 7:14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " mutabani w'omukazi ow'omuri beene Daani, ou ishe yaabaire ari owa Tuuro. Ogwo mushaija akeegyesibwa kukora eby'ezaabu, eby'efeeza, eby'emiringa, eby'ebyoma, eby'amabaare n'eby'ebiti, kandi n'eby'emyenda ya bujwa, eya bururu, eya karari n'eya kitaani; kandi naamanya n'okusharura amabara g'emiringo yoona n'okukora ekintu kyona, eki bamuhaire eky'okureeberaho kyakyo; mbwenu akwatanise n'abanyamyoga baawe, nibo ba mukama wangye omugurusi waawe Daudi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 2:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo engano na sayiri, n'amajuta na viinyo, ebi mukama wangye agambireho, abitwekyere abairu be; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.2.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.2.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
